    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python script that submits an audio file for batch transcription using a concrete external provider. I will choose Amazon Transcribe as the provider because it is a well-known service for audio transcription. The script will include the necessary imports and authentication to identify the provider. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789854949656,
